{"requested_url": "https://apps.cio.ny.gov/apps/mediacontact/public/view.cfm?parm=E4E6D5FF-C4A8-BF7F-60D8C2CB69442AF4", "final_url": "https://apps.cio.ny.gov/apps/mediacontact/public/view.cfm?parm=E4E6D5FF-C4A8-BF7F-60D8C2CB69442AF4", "collected_at_utc": "2026-10-06T15:03:43.263877+00:00", "html": "<!doctype html>\r\n\r\n<!--[if lt IE 7]> <html class=\"no-js lt-ie9 lt-ie8 lt-ie7\" lang=\"en\"> <![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 7]>    <html class=\"no-js lt-ie9 lt-ie8\" lang=\"en\"> <![endif]-->\r\n<!--[if IE 8]>    <html class=\"no-js lt-ie9\" lang=\"en\"> <![endif]-->\r\n<!-- Consider adding a manifest.appcache: h5bp.com/d/Offline -->\r\n<!--[if gt IE 8]><!--> <html class=\"no-js\" lang=\"en\"> <!--<![endif]-->\r\n<head>\r\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\r\n\t\r\n\t<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\">\r\n\t\r\n\r\n\t<title>mediacontact</title>\r\n\t<meta name=\"description\" content=\"NYS News\">\r\n\r\n\t\r\n\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width\">\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\r\n\t\t<!-- Theme Styles https://apps.cio.ny.gov/apps/mediacontact/themes/mediaContact -->\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<link href=\"https://apps.cio.ny.gov/apps/mediacontact/themes/mediaContact/favicon.ico\" rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/x-icon\" />\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://apps.cio.ny.gov/apps/mediacontact/themes/mediaContact/jquery-ui-1.8.23.custom.css\" />\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://apps.cio.ny.gov/apps/mediacontact/themes/mediaContact/errorsAndFeedback.css\" />\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://apps.cio.ny.gov/apps/mediacontact/themes/mediaContact/style.css\" />\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<!--[if lt IE 10]><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://apps.cio.ny.gov/apps/mediacontact/themes/mediaContact/ie.css\" /><![endif]-->\r\n\t\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://apps.cio.ny.gov/apps/mediacontact/themes/mediaContact/public.css\"> <script src=\"https://apps.cio.ny.gov/apps/mediacontact/js/libs/modern